# Golden files are byte-for-byte oracles (ASOP step 3/4 gates compare
# actual output against them literally). Git must never rewrite their line
# endings on checkout - a Windows runner's default autocrlf=true silently
# turned committed LF into CRLF, which made the characterization tests fail
# against their own captured output on the very next legacy.yml run. See
# asop/runs/feed/v1/EVIDENCE.md.
modernization/**/golden/** -text
